# Ryan Deverman

> Ryan Deverman is a product designer and growth product manager based in Madison, Wisconsin, with 19 years in B2B SaaS across UX, product design, product management and growth marketing. He is open to senior and principal roles in product design, UX and growth product, and to selected consulting projects.

Key facts, each tied to a role:
- Growth Product Manager, ConstructConnect, Nov 2022 – Jan 2026: built the case for product-led growth, presented to VP and C-suite leadership; scaled self-serve subscription revenue to $10M+ ARR; ran a 1.7M-page programmatic SEO system (about 1M pages indexed).
- Senior UX/UI Designer, ConstructConnect, May 2013 – Nov 2022: helped grow the design team from 2 to 12; design system and WCAG 2.1 standards for a platform with 500K+ users.
- Senior Designer, LiveText, Sep 2007 – May 2013: sole designer for an education technology platform used by 600+ colleges and universities.
- BFA, Graphic Design and Printmaking, Ohio University, 2007; Charles Logan Smith Award for Excellence in Design.

